# Soma Soft Badges

Soft badges (Recommended, status chips, tippable member badges, etc.) are **rounded rectangles**, not pills.

## Shape (required)

- Corner radius: **6px** exactly (`border-radius: 6px` or `var(--radius-sm)` when that token is 6px)
- Never use `border-radius: 9999px`, `var(--radius-full)`, or fully pill/capsule ends on soft badges
- Applies in Figma, prototypes, and product UI

```
✅ Soft badge — 6px corners, light fill + subtle border, icon + label
❌ Soft badge as a pill with semicircle ends
```

## Placement (list / table rows)

When a soft badge sits in a benefit list row:

- Place **Recommended** in the **Last Activity** column (right-aligned), not inline after the name — same right edge as activity timestamps / em dashes
- Name column is name-only and ellipsizes; empty space grows between name and the activity/badge column
- When a row has last-activity text, show that instead of the badge; when Recommended (no activity), show badge then an em dash; when neither, show an em dash alone
- Recommended flag: Streamline Ultimate **Bold** filled flag (~11px), not a thin line icon

## Popovers

Hover tips that show the same status must reuse the **same** soft badge component/styles (6px radius, same colors), not a separate pill variant.
